-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Claw_of_Vulkoor\" title=\"The Claw of Vulkoor\">The Claw of Vulkoor</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Divine_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Divine Blessing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Divine_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Divine Blessing</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Light, Alignment, and Positive Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Light, Alignment, and Positive Spellpower</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Turning\" title=\"Lesser Turning\">Lesser Turning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Turning\" title=\"Lesser Turning\">Lesser Turning</a>:</b> Increases total number of <a href=\"/page/Turn_Undead\" title=\"Turn Undead\">Turn Undead</a> uses by 2, once wielder rests. If you unequip the item you will lose these turns.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +5</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sacred_Band.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sacred_Band.png/420px-Sacred_Band.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"389\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Sacred_Band.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Sacred_Band\" title=\"Item:Epic Sacred Band\">Epic Sacred Band</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Though used primarily by drow ascetics, this ring will aid any healer in his or her duties.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>Completes to a set item with the <a href=\"/page/Item:Sacred_Helm\" title=\"Item:Sacred Helm\">Sacred Helm</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224948\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.138 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3400/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21933/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6004/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n118.43%  143.884     44 Template:IO\n100.00%  121.489      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  121.489      1 -total\n 97.10%  117.964      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 39.85%   48.408      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.07%   47.469      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.27%   46.498      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.81%   44.717      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.71%   28.806      6 Template:Popup\n 16.72%   20.309      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12034-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817224948 and revision id 634420. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
